SPINNER / NO-WEDGE CHECK (the specific risk of the new early exit): the early return
calls setRefreshing(false) before returning because the pinned unconditional call sits
at the method tail and is NOT in a `finally`. Post-race recovery was verified live:
re-entering Grocery at 14:40:3x fired the complete cold-open set, and an immediate
pull-to-refresh fired the complete refresh fan-out again (campaigns/basic and
advertisement/list each fired twice = cold open + refresh). No stuck spinner, no wedge.

